OL,3,GNEWSAHome-schooled children help
OL,4,Auncover mystery of lost building
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of home-educated children have
OL,7,Fbeen getting their hands dirty as they
OL,8,Fhelp archaeologists uncover the remains
OL,9,Fof a mysterious building.
OL,11,FThe youngsters swapped their usual
OL,12,Flessons for an archaeological dig,
OL,13,Fworking alongside experts to discover
OL,14,Fwhat lies beneath the ground.
OL,16,FThe building, which appeared on an
OL,17,F18th-century map before disappearing
OL,18,Ffrom later records, has left
OL,19,Fresearchers searching for answers about
OL,20,Fits original purpose.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
